WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:02.430
You looked it up yesterday.

2
00:00:02.430 --> 00:00:04.040
Today, it's gone.

3
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.410
With Panna, find any word in seconds.

4
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:10.750
Say it, type it, or share it from another app.

5
00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:13.550
See what it means in Hindi, how it's used,

6
00:00:14.010 --> 00:00:16.390
and the words that are similar and opposite.

7
00:00:16.820 --> 00:00:18.040
Now, the part that matters.

8
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:22.480
Save a word, and Panna brings it back at just the right time.

9
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:23.670
Pick the meaning.

10
00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:25.040
Fill in the blank.

11
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:27.180
Until the word is yours.

12
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:31.420
And when you feel like playing, a new word duel waits every day.

13
00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:33.040
Panna.

14
00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:34.440
Don't just look it up.

15
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:37.000
Keep it.
